---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---
<BaseLayout title="About · Gabrielle Uy" description="Bits and breaches — Gabrielle's portfolio, repository, and tech junk.">
  <section class="about-grid">
  <article class="prose">
    <h1>bits and breaches</h1>

    <p>
      I'm Gabrielle. I work in cybersecurity by day. The rest of the time I'm
      rummaging for things to do — coffee experiments, journaling, sending
      postcards, photography, stationery(-ing), gaming, and doing yoga (sports
      occasionally).
    </p>
    <p>
      This is my portfolio, repository, tech "junk", and so on. This website
      only consists of my technical side while I have a separate website for
      my hobbies.
    </p>
    <p>
      My first background on tech is on web development. I shifted to
      cybersecurity and decided that cybersecurity is really the path that I
      want to continue on. Cybersecurity because everything that interests me
      away from technology coincides with the process of cybersecurity — from
      documenting (photography and journaling), dealing with threats (gaming),
      and sports (keeping active).
    </p>
    <p>
      The inspiration for this website is from my fascination with pixel
      themes, games, and art. Old school technological UIs are also a strike
      to my heart.
    </p>
    <p class="ps">
      <strong>P.S.</strong> <strong>Bella</strong> is my cat and the site
      mascot. Her threat model is primarily catnip-related. She finds the gaps.
    </p>

    <section class="resume" id="resume">
      <div class="resume-head">
        <h2>resume</h2>
        <a href="/resume.pdf" class="resume-download" download>↓ download pdf</a>
      </div>

      <p class="resume-summary">
        Cybersecurity Analyst specializing in threat assessment, vulnerability
        management, and incident response. Experienced implementing security
        frameworks (NIST, ISO 27001, MITRE ATT&amp;CK) and automating workflows
        through SOAR playbooks. CompTIA Security+ and ISC2 CC certified.
      </p>

      <h3 class="resume-sub">experience</h3>

      <div class="job">
        <div class="job-head">
          <div>
            <div class="job-company">Webserves Inc.</div>
            <div class="job-role">Cybersecurity Analyst &amp; Web App Manager</div>
          </div>
          <div class="job-dates">May 2024 — Feb 2026</div>
        </div>
        <ul class="dash-list">
          <li>
            Monitored and secured client web applications (WordPress sites,
            Microsoft 365 portals, Canva integrations) — identifying outdated
            SSL certificates, exposed admin interfaces, unsecured password reset
            portals, and insecure data exchange APIs to reduce attack surface.
          </li>
          <li>
            Developed Incident Response, Disaster Recovery, and Business
            Continuity Plans covering phishing attacks and data breaches —
            establishing procedures for credential compromise, donor data
            protection, and backup restoration.
          </li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <div class="job">
        <div class="job-head">
          <div>
            <div class="job-company">Fordham Center for Cybersecurity</div>
            <div class="job-role">Cybersecurity Assistant &amp; Educator</div>
          </div>
          <div class="job-dates">Aug 2022 — May 2024</div>
        </div>
        <ul class="dash-list">
          <li>
            Developed and delivered security awareness training with simulated
            phishing exercises for university staff, reducing phishing incidents.
          </li>
          <li>
            Implemented SOAR playbooks to automate incident response for malware
            detection, unauthorized network access, and data exfiltration alerts.
          </li>
          <li>
            Integrated MITRE ATT&amp;CK framework into cybersecurity education
            and vulnerability assessments, mapping weaknesses to adversary tactics.
          </li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <div class="job">
        <div class="job-head">
          <div>
            <div class="job-company">Fordham Graduate School of Arts &amp; Sciences</div>
            <div class="job-role">Web Development &amp; Marketing Strategies</div>
          </div>
          <div class="job-dates">Oct 2023 — May 2024</div>
        </div>
        <ul class="dash-list">
          <li>
            Integrated Google Analytics with web server logs to monitor user
            behavior and identify anomalies including automated bot-like behavior.
          </li>
          <li>
            Configured Terminal4 security settings — user role assignments,
            section-level access controls — to enforce least-privilege.
          </li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <div class="job">
        <div class="job-head">
          <div>
            <div class="job-company">Fiber-Rex Philippines Inc.</div>
            <div class="job-role">Web Development &amp; Management</div>
          </div>
          <div class="job-dates">Apr 2020 — Apr 2021</div>
        </div>
        <ul class="dash-list">
          <li>
            Led development of secure company web platforms with authentication,
            access control, and data protection mechanisms.
          </li>
          <li>
            Designed resilient architectures to mitigate identity theft,
            unauthorized access, and data manipulation risks.
          </li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <h3 class="resume-sub">education</h3>
      <div class="edu">
        <div class="edu-row">
          <div>
            <div class="edu-degree">M.Sc. Cybersecurity</div>
            <div class="edu-school">Fordham University · New York, NY</div>
          </div>
          <div class="edu-dates">Aug 2022 — May 2024</div>
        </div>
        <div class="edu-row">
          <div>
            <div class="edu-degree">B.Sc. Information Technology</div>
            <div class="edu-school">Mapúa University · Makati City, Philippines</div>
          </div>
          <div class="edu-dates">Aug 2017 — Apr 2021</div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <h3 class="resume-sub">certifications</h3>
      <ul class="cert-list">
        <li>
          <a href="https://www.credly.com/badges/00060ebb-6c79-4426-8483-1627f3c01ffe/public_url" target="_blank" rel="noopener">
            <strong>CompTIA Security+ ce</strong>
          </a> · CompTIA (2024)
        </li>
        <li>
          <a href="https://www.credly.com/badges/a5d2c2ab-59d1-4c5f-bee2-67c941083c3e/public_url" target="_blank" rel="noopener">
            <strong>Certified in Cybersecurity (CC)</strong>
          </a> · ISC2 (2024)
        </li>
        <li>
          <a href="https://www.credential.net/06a2f791-4c01-41c8-b2cc-8e1fb971171b#acc.uyY1nz5f" target="_blank" rel="noopener">
            <strong>The Legend of Python</strong>
          </a> · Codédex (2024)
        </li>
        <li>
          <a href="https://www.credential.net/358c9c9a-4ad6-4da8-8139-73f17f29b2c5#acc.7c4peZLT" target="_blank" rel="noopener">
            <strong>The Origins of HTML I</strong>
          </a> · Codédex (2024)
        </li>
      </ul>

      <h3 class="resume-sub">skills</h3>
      <div class="skill-tags">
        <span class="skill">threat assessment</span>
        <span class="skill">vulnerability management</span>
        <span class="skill">incident response</span>
        <span class="skill">NIST</span>
        <span class="skill">ISO 27001</span>
        <span class="skill">MITRE ATT&amp;CK</span>
        <span class="skill">SOAR</span>
        <span class="skill">SIEM</span>
        <span class="skill">log analysis</span>
        <span class="skill">intrusion detection</span>
        <span class="skill">pentesting</span>
        <!-- from CompTIA Security+ -->
        <span class="skill">network security</span>
        <span class="skill">cryptography</span>
        <span class="skill">identity &amp; access management</span>
        <span class="skill">risk management</span>
        <span class="skill">security operations</span>
        <span class="skill">governance, risk &amp; compliance</span>
        <!-- from ISC2 CC -->
        <span class="skill">security principles</span>
        <span class="skill">business continuity</span>
        <span class="skill">disaster recovery</span>
        <span class="skill">access control</span>
        <!-- languages & tools -->
        <span class="skill">Python</span>
        <span class="skill">C++</span>
        <span class="skill">SQL</span>
        <span class="skill">HTML</span>
        <span class="skill">Azure</span>
      </div>
    </section>
  </article>

  <aside class="contact-aside">
    <div class="aside-stack">
      <div class="aside-block">
        <h2 class="aside-head">contact</h2>

        <div class="terminal" role="region" aria-label="Contact terminal">
          <div class="terminal-titlebar">
            <span class="dot dot-red" aria-hidden="true"></span>
            <span class="dot dot-yellow" aria-hidden="true"></span>
            <span class="dot dot-green" aria-hidden="true"></span>
            <span class="terminal-title">~/contact &mdash; gabrielle@gabieuy</span>
          </div>
          <div class="terminal-body">
            <p class="line"><span class="prompt">gabrielle@gabieuy</span><span class="path">:~$</span> <span class="cmd">whoami</span></p>
            <p class="line output">gabrielle uy</p>
            <p class="line"><span class="prompt">gabrielle@gabieuy</span><span class="path">:~$</span> <span class="cmd">cat ./contact.txt</span></p>
            <p class="line output"><span class="key">email</span>     <a href="mailto:gabrielleag.uy@gmail.com">gabrielleag.uy@gmail.com</a></p>
            <p class="line output"><span class="key">linkedin</span>  <a href="https://linkedin.com/gabrielleaguy">linkedin.com/gabrielleaguy</a></p>
            <p class="line output"><span class="key">github</span>    <a href="https://github.com/gabie-uy">github.com/gabie-uy</a></p>
            <p class="line"><span class="prompt">gabrielle@gabieuy</span><span class="path">:~$</span> <span class="cursor" aria-hidden="true"></span></p>
          </div>
        </div>

      </div>
    </div>
  </aside>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .about-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr) 22rem;
    gap: 2.5rem;
    align-items: start;
    padding-top: 1rem;
  }
  @media (max-width: 760px) {
    .about-grid {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      gap: 2.5rem;
    }
  }

  .contact-aside { min-width: 0; }
  @media (min-width: 761px) {
    .contact-aside {
      position: sticky;
      top: 5.5rem;
    }
  }
  .contact-aside .aside-head {
    font-family: var(--pixel);
    -webkit-font-smoothing: none;
    font-smooth: never;
    font-size: 1.25rem;
    letter-spacing: 0.04em;
    margin: 1rem 0 1.2rem;
    padding-bottom: 0.5rem;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--rule);
    color: var(--ink);
  }

  .prose { max-width: 36rem; padding: 1rem 0; font-size: 0.95rem; line-height: 1.65; }
  .prose h1 {
    font-family: var(--pixel);
    -webkit-font-smoothing: none;
    font-smooth: never;
    font-size: 1.15rem;
    letter-spacing: 0.02em;
    margin: 0 0 1.2rem;
  }
  .prose h2 {
    font-family: var(--pixel);
    -webkit-font-smoothing: none;
    font-smooth: never;
    font-size: 1.25rem;
    letter-spacing: 0.04em;
    margin: 3rem 0 1.2rem;
    padding-bottom: 0.5rem;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--rule);
  }
  .prose p { margin: 1rem 0; }
  .prose .ps {
    font-style: italic;
    color: var(--ink-soft);
    margin: 1rem 0;
  }
  .prose .lede {
    font-size: 1.02rem;
    line-height: 1.55;
    color: var(--ink-soft);
    margin-bottom: 1.3rem;
  }
  .prose strong { font-weight: 600; }
  .prose a { color: var(--accent); text-decoration-color: var(--rule); }
  .prose a:hover { color: var(--warm); }

  /* ───── Resume section ───── */
  .resume { margin-top: 3rem; }
  .resume-head {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: space-between;
    gap: 1rem;
    margin: 0 0 1.2rem;
    padding-bottom: 0.5rem;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--rule);
  }
  .resume-head h2 {
    font-family: var(--pixel);
    -webkit-font-smoothing: none;
    font-smooth: never;
    font-size: 1.25rem;
    letter-spacing: 0.04em;
    margin: 0;
    padding: 0;
    border: none;
  }
  .resume-download {
    font-family: var(--pixel);
    -webkit-font-smoothing: none;
    font-smooth: never;
    font-size: 0.72rem;
    letter-spacing: 0.06em;
    padding: 0.45rem 0.7rem 0.35rem;
    background: var(--accent);
    color: white !important;
    text-decoration: none !important;
    transition: background 0.15s ease;
    white-space: nowrap;
  }
  .resume-download:hover {
    background: var(--warm);
    color: white !important;
  }
  .resume-summary {
    font-size: 1rem;
    color: var(--ink-soft);
    line-height: 1.65;
    margin: 0 0 2rem;
  }
  .resume-sub {
    font-family: var(--pixel);
    -webkit-font-smoothing: none;
    font-smooth: never;
    font-size: 1.1rem;
    letter-spacing: 0.06em;
    color: var(--ink);
    margin: 2.4rem 0 1.1rem;
    text-transform: uppercase;
  }

  /* Job entries */
  .job { margin: 0 0 1.5rem; }
  .job-head {
    display: flex;
    align-items: baseline;
    justify-content: space-between;
    gap: 1rem;
    margin: 0 0 0.5rem;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
  }
  .job-company {
    font-size: 1.02rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    color: var(--ink);
  }
  .job-role {
    font-size: 0.95rem;
    color: var(--accent);
    font-style: italic;
  }
  .job-dates {
    font-family: var(--pixel);
    -webkit-font-smoothing: none;
    font-smooth: never;
    font-size: 0.66rem;
    letter-spacing: 0.04em;
    color: var(--ink-soft);
    white-space: nowrap;
  }
  .job .dash-list { margin: 0.3rem 0 0; }
  .job .dash-list li { font-size: 0.95rem; line-height: 1.55; }

  /* Education */
  .edu { margin: 0 0 1rem; }
  .edu-row {
    display: flex;
    align-items: baseline;
    justify-content: space-between;
    gap: 1rem;
    margin: 0 0 0.9rem;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
  }
  .edu-degree {
    font-size: 1rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    color: var(--ink);
  }
  .edu-school {
    font-size: 0.92rem;
    color: var(--ink-soft);
  }
  .edu-dates {
    font-family: var(--pixel);
    -webkit-font-smoothing: none;
    font-smooth: never;
    font-size: 0.66rem;
    letter-spacing: 0.04em;
    color: var(--ink-soft);
    white-space: nowrap;
  }

  /* Certifications */
  .cert-list {
    list-style: none;
    padding: 0;
    margin: 0;
  }
  .cert-list li {
    padding: 0.35rem 0;
    font-size: 0.95rem;
    color: var(--ink-soft);
    border-bottom: 1px dotted var(--rule);
  }
  .cert-list li:last-child { border-bottom: none; }
  .cert-list strong { color: var(--ink); }
  .prose .cert-list a {
    color: var(--ink);
    font-weight: 700;
    text-decoration: none;
    transition: color 0.15s ease;
  }
  .prose .cert-list a:hover {
    color: var(--warm);
    text-decoration: none;
  }
  .prose .cert-list a strong {
    font-weight: inherit;
    color: inherit;
  }

  /* Skill tags */
  .skill-tags {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 0.5rem;
  }
  .skill {
    font-family: var(--pixel);
    -webkit-font-smoothing: none;
    font-smooth: never;
    font-size: 0.8rem;
    letter-spacing: 0.04em;
    padding: 0.4rem 0.7rem 0.32rem;
    background: var(--paper-warm);
    border: 1px solid var(--rule);
    color: var(--ink);
    line-height: 1;
    transition: background 0.15s ease, border-color 0.15s ease, color 0.15s ease;
  }
  .skill:hover {
    background: white;
    border-color: var(--accent);
    color: var(--accent);
  }

  /* Aside stack — what i do + contact, both sticky */
  .aside-stack {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 1.8rem;
  }
  .aside-block { min-width: 0; }
  .aside-lede {
    font-size: 0.95rem;
    line-height: 1.55;
    color: var(--ink-soft);
    margin: 0 0 0.8rem;
    font-style: italic;
  }
  .aside-list {
    margin: 0;
  }
  .aside-list li {
    font-size: 0.88rem;
    line-height: 1.5;
    margin: 0.35rem 0;
  }

  /* Dash-list (no bullet markers, em-dashes inline for the prose lists) */
  .dash-list {
    list-style: none;
    padding-left: 0;
    margin: 1rem 0;
  }
  .dash-list li {
    padding-left: 1.2rem;
    position: relative;
    margin: 0.35rem 0;
    line-height: 1.6;
  }
  .dash-list li::before {
    content: '—';
    position: absolute;
    left: 0;
    color: var(--ink-soft);
  }

  /* Terminal-style contact block */
  .terminal {
    background: #1c2230;
    border: 1px solid #2a3142;
    border-radius: 6px;
    overflow: hidden;
    font-family: var(--mono);
    margin: 1.2rem 0 1rem;
    box-shadow: 0 6px 24px rgba(28, 34, 48, 0.18);
  }
  .terminal-titlebar {
    background: #2a3142;
    padding: 0.55rem 0.9rem;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.45rem;
  }
  .dot {
    display: inline-block;
    width: 11px;
    height: 11px;
    border-radius: 50%;
  }
  .dot-red { background: #ff5f56; }
  .dot-yellow { background: #ffbd2e; }
  .dot-green { background: #27c93f; }
  .terminal-title {
    margin-left: 0.8rem;
    font-family: var(--mono);
    font-size: 0.78rem;
    color: rgba(240, 235, 224, 0.55);
  }
  .terminal-body {
    padding: 0.9rem 1rem 1.1rem;
    font-family: var(--mono);
    font-size: 0.76rem;
    line-height: 1.8;
    color: #d4d0c4;
  }
  .terminal-body .line { margin: 0; }
  .terminal-body .prompt { color: #6dd17b; }
  .terminal-body .path { color: #7bb1d9; margin-right: 0.5rem; }
  .terminal-body .cmd { color: #f0ebe0; }
  .terminal-body .output { color: #d4d0c4; padding-left: 0; }
  .terminal-body .key {
    display: inline-block;
    min-width: 4.5rem;
    color: #f5a061;
  }
  .terminal-body a {
    color: #7bb1d9;
    text-decoration: none;
    border-bottom: 1px dashed rgba(123, 177, 217, 0.4);
  }
  .terminal-body a:hover {
    color: #ffbd6a;
    border-bottom-color: #ffbd6a;
  }
  .terminal-body .cursor {
    display: inline-block;
    background: #f0ebe0;
    width: 0.55rem;
    height: 0.95rem;
    vertical-align: -2px;
    animation: blink 1.1s steps(1) infinite;
  }

  .also-at {
    font-family: var(--pixel);
    -webkit-font-smoothing: none;
    font-smooth: never;
    font-size: 0.7rem;
    letter-spacing: 0.04em;
    color: var(--ink-soft);
    margin: 0.5rem 0 0;
  }
  .also-at a {
    color: var(--ink-soft);
    text-decoration: none;
    border-bottom: 1px dotted var(--rule);
  }
  .also-at a:hover { color: var(--warm); border-bottom-color: var(--warm); }

  /* PGP fingerprint */
  .fingerprint {
    font-family: var(--mono);
    font-size: 0.85rem;
    background: var(--paper-warm);
    padding: 0.2rem 0.45rem;
    border: 1px solid var(--rule);
    display: inline-block;
    margin: 0.2rem 0;
    color: var(--ink);
    letter-spacing: 0.04em;
  }
  .note {
    font-size: 0.88rem;
    color: var(--ink-soft);
  }
</style>
